{"t":"VLO","n":"Valero Energy Corporation","nKo":"발레로 에너지","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":329.4,"chg":-4.78,"chgPct":-0.0143,"prev":334.18,"dayH":339.02,"dayL":328.14,"w52H":461.52,"w52L":159.9,"vol":2739773,"avgVol":2691740,"mcap":91864522752,"pe":7.49,"fpe":6.51,"eps":43.97,"feps":50.57,"pb":3.28,"div":4.8,"divY":0.0146,"beta":0.55,"short":6931945,"shortPct":0.029,"shortRatio":2.61,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Energy","sKo":"에너지","i":"Oil & Gas Refining & Marketing","iKo":"석유 및 가스 정제 및 마케팅","city":"San Antonio","emp":9785,"web":"https://www.valero.com","sum":"Valero Energy Corporation manufactures, markets, and sells petroleum-based and low-carbon liquid transportation fuels and petrochemical products in the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, Ireland, Latin America, Mexico, Peru, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Refining, Renewable Diesel, and Ethanol. The company produces California Reformulated Gasoline Blendstock for Oxygenate Blending (CARBOB) and Conventional Blendstock for Oxygenate Blending (CBOB) gasolines, CARB diesel, diesel, jet fuel, heating oil, and asphalt; feedstocks; aromatics; sulfur and residual fuel oil; intermediate oils; and sulfur, sweet, and sour crude oils. It sells its refined products through wholesale rack and bulk markets; and through outlets under the Valero, Beacon, Diamond Shamrock,","sumKo":"Valero Energy Corporation은 미국, 캐나다, 영국, 아일랜드, 라틴 아메리카, 멕시코, 페루 및 국제적으로 석유 기반 저탄소 액체 운송 연료와 석유화학 제품을 제조, 판매 및 판매합니다. 정제, 재생 디젤, 에탄올의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 CARBOB(산소 혼합용 캘리포니아 개질 가솔린 혼합 원료) 및 CBOB(산소 혼합 원료) 가솔린, CARB 디젤, 디젤, 제트 연료, 난방유 및 아스팔트를 생산합니다. 공급원료; 방향족; 황 및 잔류 연료유; 중간유; 유황, 감미료 및 신맛 원유. 도매 랙 및 벌크 시장을 통해 정제된 제품을 판매합니다. Valero, Beacon, Diamond Shamrock,"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":176383000000,"ni":11528000000},{"y":2023,"rev":144766000000,"ni":8835000000},{"y":2024,"rev":129881000000,"ni":2770000000},{"y":2025,"rev":122687000000,"ni":2348000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":3037200